# Oldest PicPeak version that may update to this release with the in-app
# updater. CI bakes it into the backend image as the
# io.picpeak.update.auto-from label (.github/workflows/docker-build.yml).
#
# Leave it empty while every release can be reached by `pull && up -d`.
# When a release needs manual operator steps (a compose file change, a new
# required env var, a Postgres major upgrade), set this to that release's
# version in its release PR. Installs older than it are then refused and
# pointed at the release notes, including installs that skip over it later.
#
# One version per file, the first non-comment line counts, e.g.:
# 3.160.0
